language sdl-mvp1-exercise version 0.1.

scenario ImportApt.
condition ImportAptReady.
condition ImportAptContinue.
condition ImportAptReject.
outcome ImportAptCompleted.
outcome ImportAptRejected.
step ImportAptIntent.
step ImportAptRoute.
step ImportAptDecode.
step ImportAptAccept.
step ImportAptProject.
step ImportAptSchema.
step ImportAptFailure.
step ImportAptSuccess.

ImportApt illustrates ManageAptDefinitions.
ImportApt exercises ValidatedAptDefinitions.
ImportApt starts-when ImportAptReady.
ImportApt starts-at ImportAptIntent.
ImportAptReady describes "An identified user or tool requests import of a supported file.".
ImportAptContinue describes "The previous operation succeeded and the next step's declared contract preconditions remain true; exact predicates are an executable-language gap.".
ImportAptReject describes "Validation, authority, applicability or operation failure prevents continuation; preserve prior valid state and report the specific reason.".
ImportAptCompleted describes "The stated design path completed under its explicit obligations; this is not an observed test result.".
ImportAptRejected describes "The path terminated without claiming the requested change succeeded; failures remain observable.".
ImportApt preserves DomainTruthOwned.
ImportApt preserves ConservativeQuality.
ImportAptIntent calls SubmitUiCommand within BuckingUI.
ImportAptIntent describes "Explicit new action identity and target owner.".
ImportAptIntent proceeds-to ImportAptFailure when ImportAptReject.
ImportAptIntent proceeds-to ImportAptRoute when ImportAptContinue.
ImportAptRoute calls RouteBrowserCommand within BuckingWeb.
ImportAptRoute describes "Route APT import to Bucking, preserving identity.".
ImportAptRoute proceeds-to ImportAptFailure when ImportAptReject.
ImportAptRoute proceeds-to ImportAptDecode when ImportAptContinue.
ImportAptDecode calls DecodeClassicApt within BuckingService.
ImportAptDecode describes "Supported Classic fixture semantics only; other codecs require explicit support.".
ImportAptDecode proceeds-to ImportAptFailure when ImportAptReject.
ImportAptDecode proceeds-to ImportAptAccept when ImportAptContinue.
ImportAptAccept calls ImportAptDefinition within BuckingService.
ImportAptAccept describes "Preserve source digest/common/extensions; activation remains separate policy.".
ImportAptAccept proceeds-to ImportAptFailure when ImportAptReject.
ImportAptAccept proceeds-to ImportAptProject when ImportAptContinue.
ImportAptProject calls ProjectAptAvailability within BuckingUI.
ImportAptProject describes "Absent standard-specific data stays unavailable.".
ImportAptProject proceeds-to ImportAptFailure when ImportAptReject.
ImportAptProject proceeds-to ImportAptSchema when ImportAptContinue.
ImportAptSchema calls BuildPresentationSchema within BuckingUI.
ImportAptSchema describes "Rebuild only for structural discriminator change.".
ImportAptSchema proceeds-to ImportAptFailure when ImportAptReject.
ImportAptSchema proceeds-to ImportAptSuccess when ImportAptContinue.
ImportAptFailure finishes ImportApt with ImportAptRejected.
ImportAptSuccess finishes ImportApt with ImportAptCompleted.
ImportAptIntent emits OperatorBrowserRequests through OperatorBrowserChannel.
ImportAptRoute receives OperatorBrowserRequests through OperatorBrowserChannel.
ImportAptRoute emits BuckingRequests through BuckingServiceUpstream.
ImportAptAccept receives BuckingRequests through BuckingServiceUpstream.
